      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry—what do you mean by \"goblin touch\"? I just need the actual math for the inventory system. Can we just stick to the technical side? Also, how do I account for the fact that the lead time itself fluctuates, not just the demand?",
      "source": "evaluator"
