      "content": "That math makes sense. One thing though—we occasionally see these \"ghost\" errors where the system says we have stock, but the physical count is way off, almost like items are just vanishing or the data is being corrupted randomly. It's driving our ops team crazy. Is there a way to build a logic check into the reorder system to account for these kinds of unaccounted-for discrepancies?",
